  message: "OWNER RULINGS 2026-11-21 (after the concept audit docs/audits/0027 and its review against ADR-0024/0027/0028/0039/0056): (1) program start = manifest bin, convention main, main_guard, electron_main only; shell_script/script_module stay fallback; android_application and the Verilog top module are hosted application. (2) server-hosted app objects (15 rows) move to a new kind hosted_application ranked with routes; the other 18 application rows split four ways; ships only if a service with no main still auto-slices from its app or a covering route (A/B). (3) delete cli_main, the 21 framework-named kinds and electron_renderer; add a producer for electron_preload; SCHEMA_VERSION 0.22.0. Built as one PR, in order: WI-jilik (dead kinds) -> WI-giron (entrypoint-kind axis registry, roles) -> WI-fasij (hosted_application + dedup fix). Residual: WI-rafop (concept names no detector reads). Ranking question 1 of this item is answered by rulings 1-2; the concept question 2 by the audit."  # 2709
